<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>CampusCanteen Production Deployment Guide</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { color: #111827; border-bottom: 3px solid #ea580c; padding-bottom: 8px; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
    h2 { color: #1f2937; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16pt; border-left: 4px solid #ea580c; padding-left: 10px; }
    h3 { color: #374151; font-size: 13pt; margin-top: 18px; }
    p { font-size: 11pt; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 10.5pt; }
    th { background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #111827; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 10px; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; }
    td { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 9px 10px; text-align: left; }
    tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f9fafb; }
    .code { font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace; background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: #111827; font-weight: bold; }
    .highlight { background-color: #ffedf0; color: #9f1239; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; }
    ol, ul { padding-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt; }
    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>CampusCanteen — Step-by-Step Production Deployment Guide</h1>
  <p>This document provides complete instructions for deploying the <strong>CampusCanteen MERN Stack Application</strong> to free / cloud hosting platforms (<strong>Render</strong>, <strong>Vercel</strong>, and <strong>Neon PostgreSQL</strong>).</p>

  <h2>1. Architecture Summary</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Component</th>
        <th>Technology</th>
        <th>Recommended Cloud Platform</th>
        <th>Free Tier Supported</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Database</strong></td>
        <td>PostgreSQL</td>
        <td>Neon.tech / Supabase / Render DB</td>
        <td>Yes</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Backend API</strong></td>
        <td>Node.js Express + Socket.IO</td>
        <td>Render.com Web Service</td>
        <td>Yes</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Frontend SPA</strong></td>
        <td>React 19 + Vite</td>
        <td>Vercel / Netlify</td>
        <td>Yes</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Media Uploads</strong></td>
        <td>Cloudinary SDK</td>
        <td>Cloudinary</td>
        <td>Yes</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Payments</strong></td>
        <td>Razorpay SDK</td>
        <td>Razorpay Dashboard</td>
        <td>Test & Live Mode</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>2. Step 1: Set Up Cloud PostgreSQL Database (Neon.tech)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Sign up for a free account at <strong><a href="https://neon.tech">https://neon.tech</a></strong>.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Create Project</strong>, name it <span class="code">campuscanteen-db</span>, and select your region.</li>
    <li>Copy the generated PostgreSQL Connection String:
      <p class="code">postgres://username:password@ep-host-name.pooler.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require</p>
    </li>
    <li>Save this string as your production <span class="code">DATABASE_URL</span>.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>3. Step 2: Deploy Backend API to Render (Web Service)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Push your project codebase to <strong>GitHub</strong>.</li>
    <li>Sign up at <strong><a href="https://render.com">https://render.com</a></strong>.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>New +</strong> &rarr; <strong>Web Service</strong>.</li>
    <li>Connect your GitHub repository.</li>
    <li>Configure settings:
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Name:</strong> <span class="code">campuscanteen-backend</span></li>
        <li><strong>Root Directory:</strong> <span class="code">backend</span></li>
        <li><strong>Runtime:</strong> <span class="code">Node</span></li>
        <li><strong>Build Command:</strong> <span class="code">npm install && npm run build</span></li>
        <li><strong>Start Command:</strong> <span class="code">npm start</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Add <strong>Environment Variables</strong> under Render Dashboard:</li>
  </ol>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Variable Key</th>
        <th>Example Value</th>
        <th>Notes</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">PORT</span></td>
        <td>5000</td>
        <td>Port for Express server</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">NODE_ENV</span></td>
        <td>production</td>
        <td>Production environment</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">DATABASE_URL</span></td>
        <td>postgres://...</td>
        <td>Connection string from Neon.tech</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">JWT_SECRET</span></td>
        <td>super_secret_jwt_key_2026</td>
        <td>Random secure string</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">CLIENT_URL</span></td>
        <td>https://campuscanteen.vercel.app</td>
        <td>Production frontend URL</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">RAZORPAY_KEY_ID</span></td>
        <td>rzp_test_xxxxxx</td>
        <td>Razorpay Key ID</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="code">RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET</span></td>
        <td>xxxxxxxxx</td>
        <td>Razorpay Key Secret</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>4. Step 3: Deploy Frontend Web App to Vercel</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Log in to <strong><a href="https://vercel.com">https://vercel.com</a></strong>.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Add New...</strong> &rarr; <strong>Project</strong> and import your GitHub repository.</li>
    <li>Configure build settings:
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Framework Preset:</strong> Vite</li>
        <li><strong>Root Directory:</strong> <span class="code">frontend</span></li>
        <li><strong>Build Command:</strong> <span class="code">npm run build</span></li>
        <li><strong>Output Directory:</strong> <span class="code">dist</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Add Environment Variables:
      <ul>
        <li><span class="code">VITE_API_URL</span>: <span class="code">https://campuscanteen-backend.onrender.com/api</span></li>
        <li><span class="code">VITE_SOCKET_URL</span>: <span class="code">https://campuscanteen-backend.onrender.com</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Click <strong>Deploy</strong>. Vercel will assign your live URL (<span class="code">https://campuscanteen.vercel.app</span>).</li>
  </ol>

</body>
</html>